commercial_notes:
Estimated ARR banded in deck. We modeled 8x commit as 'base' — gives 70% util case and meets p95 SLO with caching. If they choose 4x commit, must accept lower max throughput or higher fallbacks and higher per-token price. Add-on: Optimize service to reduce effective token burn by suggested batching/caching configs.
Pricing options in proposal:
- 6-month commit (discount X) + 1-month termination notice;
- 12-month commit (deeper discount) + SLA uplift (faster support SLAs);
- Pilot (30 days, limited RPS) to validate latency numbers with sample traffic.
POC metrics to validate: median latency, p95 latency, sustained tokens/min, model quality delta vs open baseline.
